#: src/ui/store_window.cpp
msgid "Android apps that are open close. Android stays off, also after you log in again, until you open an Android app or turn it on here."
msgstr "Aplikasi Android sing kebukak bakal ditutup. Android tetep mati, uga sawise panjenengan mlebu maneh, nganti panjenengan mbukak aplikasi Android utawa nguripake ing kene."

#: src/ui/store_window.cpp
msgid "Turn on Android apps?"
msgstr "Urupake aplikasi Android?"

#: src/ui/store_window.cpp
msgid "F-Droid apps are Android apps: they run in Android (lapis) beside the desktop. Turning it on downloads Android once (about 1.3 GB) and may ask for your password. Store settings show how it goes."
msgstr "Aplikasi F-Droid yaiku aplikasi Android: mlaku ing Android (lapis) ing sandhinge desktop. Nguripake bakal ngundhuh Android sepisan (kira-kira 1,3 GB) lan bisa takon tembung sandhi panjenengan. Setelan toko nuduhake kemajuane."

#: src/ui/store_window.cpp
msgid "OK"
msgstr "OK"

#: src/ui/widgets.cpp
msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Sunting"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Lewati"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Bali"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Start the tour"
msgstr "Miwiti tur"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Get started"
msgstr "Miwiti"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Candhake"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "WELCOME"
msgstr "SUGENG RAWUH"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Welcome to IGN 26"
msgstr "Sugeng rawuh ing IGN 26"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Bayu is ready to use. Take a short tour, under a minute, to find your way around."
msgstr "Bayu wis siap dienggo. Tutugna tur cendhak, kurang saka sak menit, supaya ngerti dununge."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "BAYU STORE"
msgstr "BAYU STORE"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Install your first app"
msgstr "Pasang aplikasi sepisanan"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Bayu Store brings thousands of apps from Flathub and F-Droid together. Search, click Install, and it is done. Some to start with:"
msgstr "Bayu Store nglumpukake ewonan aplikasi saka Flathub lan F-Droid. Golek, klik Pasang, rampung. Sawetara kanggo miwiti:"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Browse the web"
msgstr "Njelajah web"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Documents, spreadsheets and slides"
msgstr "Dokumen, lembar kerja, lan slide"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Plays any video or music"
msgstr "Muter video utawa musik apa wae"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Open Bayu Store"
msgstr "Bukak Bayu Store"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "LAUNCHER AND DOCK"
msgstr "LAUNCHER LAN DOCK"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Find every app"
msgstr "Golek kabeh aplikasi"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Click the rocket in the dock to see all your apps, and type to search. Apps you install appear there at once. Drag one to the dock to keep it at hand."
msgstr "Klik roket ing dock kanggo ndeleng kabeh aplikasimu, banjur ketik kanggo golek. Aplikasi sing mbok pasang langsung metu ing kana. Seret salah siji menyang dock supaya gampang digayuh."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Run Android apps"
msgstr "Jalanake aplikasi Android"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Android apps run in their own windows, next to your other apps, through lapis. Turning it on downloads Android once, about 1.3 GB."
msgstr "Aplikasi Android mlaku ing jendela dhewe, bebarengan karo aplikasi liyane, liwat lapis. Nguripake iki ngundhuh Android sepisan, kira-kira 1,3 GB."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "APPEARANCE"
msgstr "TAMPILAN"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Make it yours"
msgstr "Gawe cocog karo selerane"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Choose light or dark, and a wallpaper. More choices are in Settings."
msgstr "Pilih padhang utawa peteng, lan wallpaper. Pilihan liyane ana ing Setelan."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "DESKTOP LAYOUT"
msgstr "TATA LETAK DESKTOP"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Dock or panel"
msgstr "Dock utawa panel"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "The Dock keeps a bar at the top, with the menus of the app in front, and your apps in a dock. The Panel puts everything in one bar along the bottom, with each app's menus in its window. The desktop changes at once."
msgstr "Dock nyimpen bilah ing ndhuwur, isine menu aplikasi sing lagi dienggo, lan aplikasi sampeyan ing dock. Panel nyelehake kabeh ing siji bilah ing ngisor, kanthi menu saben aplikasi ing jendhelane. Desktop langsung owah."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Stay up to date"
msgstr "Tansah anyar"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "App updates are in Bayu Store, under Updates. System updates are in Settings, under System Update: they download in the background and install when you restart."
msgstr "Pembaruan aplikasi ana ing Bayu Store, ing bagean Pembaruan. Pembaruan sistem ana ing Setelan, ing bagean Pembaruan Sistem: diundhuh ing latar mburi lan dipasang nalika sampeyan miwiti maneh."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Open Updates"
msgstr "Bukak Nganyari"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "System Update"
msgstr "Pembaruan Sistem"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "Laporake masalah"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "ALL SET"
msgstr "KABEH WIS SIAP"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Enjoy IGN 26"
msgstr "Sugeng nyoba IGN 26"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Open this tour again any time from the launcher: look for Welcome."
msgstr "Bukak tur iki maneh kapan wae saka launcher: goleka Sugeng Rawuh."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Show at login"
msgstr "Tampilake nalika mlebu"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Open Welcome each time you sign in"
msgstr "Bukak Sugeng Rawuh saben mlebu"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Android apps are not available on this system."
msgstr "Aplikasi Android ora kasedhiya ing sistem iki."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Turn on Android apps"
msgstr "Uripake aplikasi Android"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Android apps are on. Find them in Bayu Store under F-Droid."
msgstr "Aplikasi Android wis diuripake. Golekana ing Bayu Store ing F-Droid."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Setting up Android"
msgstr "Nyiyapake Android"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Waiting for your password."
msgstr "Ngenteni tembung sandhi panjenengan."

